---
import LegalPage from "@/components/legal/LegalPage.astro";
---

<LegalPage title="Accessibility Statement" lastUpdated="November 5, 2026">
  <p>
    Archdrill is committed to making our service accessible to as many people as possible. This statement describes our
    approach and where we know we have room to improve.
  </p>

  <h2>Our goal</h2>
  <p>
    We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 at Level AA. This includes supporting keyboard
    navigation, providing text alternatives where practical, and maintaining readable contrast.
  </p>

  <h2>Current status</h2>
  <p>
    Archdrill is an early-stage product, and parts of the experience may not yet fully meet these guidelines. We work to
    improve accessibility as we continue development, and we welcome feedback on specific issues.
  </p>

  <h2>Feedback</h2>
  <p>
    If you encounter an accessibility barrier, please email{" "}
    <a href="mailto:support@archdrill.com">support@archdrill.com</a> and describe the issue and the page you were on. We will
    do our best to address it.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
